{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_peper_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_peper_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "少年雇佣兵",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_peper_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "784bc6a3c58cc589dadc3a0267a43d8f15115948c8295d9c3b5994875a4aa209",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵队长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "怎么样了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "text": "没走，还跟在后头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "text": "那丫头多倔你又不是不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵队长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "......替我再劝劝她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "text": "老格林，我看你是真糊涂了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "text": "现在后悔，当时又何必带着她出来？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "啰嗦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "黑市那单问题不小，两头的阔佬都想整死对方，现在货没了，他们只会把这事甩在我们头上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "要是不带上臭丫头，放城里她会死得更快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "text": "这我知道，但你现在赶她走，她也没别的地去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "......随便在路上找个镇子，能干活总能有活路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "text": "这话你自己信？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "text": "说真的，为她好，你就该多练练她。她是不是都没见过血？我是说真格的那种，不是宰两头角兽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "text": "老格林，别再做梦了，我们已经在去伦蒂尼姆的路上，以后这些都免不了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "text": "她也是个萨卡兹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "......行了，你少说两句。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "这事我心里有数。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "混蛋，混蛋，大混蛋......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "又把我当小孩，迟早让你后悔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "text": "哟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "——！敌袭？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "text": "如果真是敌袭，现在你已经没命了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "啊......什么嘛，别吓我啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "text": "我没闲到要来吓你，是你警惕性太差，自己吓自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "我是医疗人员，本来就没那么擅长战斗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "而且刚刚、刚刚是我在想事情，所以才没有注意......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "text": "行吧，你说是就是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "text": "怎么，还在生老格林的气？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "......哼，当然了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "居然在这种时候说要赶我走，你不觉得格林他过分吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "text": "呃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "我也是雇佣兵，我是小队的成员，他为什么要赶我走？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "为什么不让我和你们一起去伦蒂尼姆？明明我都跟队出过那么多次任务了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "text": "这次不一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "我没看出有什么特别的......要去的地方是有一点远，不过报酬也很丰盛啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "真要说有什么不一样的话......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "我记得格林那天回来，宣布我们要立刻启程的时候的样子。我从没见他那么激动过......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "他平时好像对什么都无所谓，但那时候不太一样。他还说，只要这次打赢了，我们就能过上好日子了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "这是真的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "text": "......谁知道呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "text": "我只想先拿到钱，其他的我没想过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "也是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "格林总觉得我什么都不懂，可我们雇佣兵不就是能赚到钱就好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "只要能养活姥姥，干什么活不都一样嘛。其他的，还要懂什么啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "要是真能拿到那笔钱......我想替姥姥换个更好点的房子，现在住的地方下雨天会进水，姥姥总说膝盖疼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "哦，对了，如果格林想要的话，我还能给他买点更好的生日礼物......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "text": "你还在想着给他过生日？他还记得自己哪天生这么无聊的事情？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "哪里无聊了？明明很有意义啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "如果不每年提醒一下自己，真的可能会忘记一年就这么又过去了，忘记自己又长大一岁，又老去一岁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "你不觉得这还挺可怕的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "text": "......大概？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "这算是什么回答，好敷衍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "text": "我说不过你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "text": "依我看，你要是直接把这话说给格林本人听，搞不好他就同意......不对，也有可能他就更不同意你跟着一起来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "欸？什么意思......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "text": "（本来还想劝劝这丫头......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "text": "（算了吧。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "text": "没什么。你就继续跟着吧，我先回前头去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "text": "干嘛啊，最讨厌说话说半截的人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "text": "神神秘秘的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "对方已经离开。前方的队伍有大约二十人，明椒只能隐约看到最末尾的人的一道影子。\n女孩沉默片刻，垂下头，从口袋里掏出了什么东西。\n那是一只毛线织的，颜色鲜亮的指套。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "格林肯定又要说颜色太亮了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "有什么关系，就是要鲜艳一点才好看嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "......要是再赶我走......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "就不把礼物给他了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "（什么声音？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "（......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "（......错觉吗？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "什么人！出来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "呵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "打中了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "你到底是什么人，有什么目的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "喂，你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "等等......别想跑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "呼......哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "追、追上你了......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑市打手",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "text": "......没想到会被个小姑娘发现。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "......那被小姑娘抓到的你又算什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "你已经跑不掉了，快说！你是什么人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑市打手",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "text": "哈，天真的小鬼。我承认你身手不错，你们萨卡兹在这一行的名声不虚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑市打手",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "text": "但你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑市打手",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "text": "脑袋空空的天真小鬼就算身手不错，也只是小鬼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "你......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "（......不行，明椒，对方是故意在激怒你......不能中计，要冷静下来......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "我警告你，别想靠说废话拖延时间......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "快点回答我的问题，否则我就要动手了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑市打手",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑市打手",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "text": "免费给你上一课，萨卡兹小鬼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "回答我的问题！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑市打手",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "text": "既然知道对方是在拖延时间，就不该继续等下去——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "什么，你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑市打手B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "text": "说完了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑市打手B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "text": "你和这小丫头废话真多！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "糟了！你、你们......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑市打手",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "text": "——动手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "可恶！你们......卑鄙！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "（不行，两边一起攻击的话......躲不过去！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "呜！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "别闭眼！盯住对手，架起武器格挡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "呃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑市打手",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "text": "嘁，麻烦的家伙来了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "别管其他人，盯紧你认准的猎物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "不要怕受伤，战斗中永远不要放开手里的武器！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "是、是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑市打手B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "text": "别太小看人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "就是现在！攻击！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "哈啊！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑市打手",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "text": "呃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "哈......哈哈！说什么别小看人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "这句话该我说——你们这些混蛋，别太——小看我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑市打手B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "text": "哈，死小鬼，你在瞄准哪里？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "你在干什么？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "我教你的都忘了吗！攻击敌人的要害！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "我、我知道......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "哈啊啊啊——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "哈......哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "都收拾掉了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "格林！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "你看到了吗？我把这两个混蛋都打趴下了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "格林......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "你怎么了，你、你在生气吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "我之前是怎么教你的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "不能轻敌，不能留手，对敌人要一击致命......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "你是怎么做的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "我......刚刚我不是故意打偏的，只是，呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "这不是还有你在嘛，不会有问题的啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "如果以后......如果我不在呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "可是，可是格林你怎么会不在？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "......没人能保证会一直在，别太天真了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑市打手",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "他们都还活着？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "呃......是的，我、我把他们打晕了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "为什么不直接杀了他们？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "这......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "没必要吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "对了，不如我把他们绑起来吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "这样的话，他们就没法通风报信......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "明椒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "你看好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "上年纪的雇佣兵拔出腰间的利刃，在年轻人的注视下将其送入战败者的咽喉。\n赤红的血溅落在明椒的护膝上，鞋面上，滚烫的热度透过布料灼烧皮肤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "这......为什么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "他们是黑市的人，是冲着我们来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "如果刚刚我没有察觉到这里的动静，今天这样躺在这里的就会是你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "......我明白！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "我知道他们没安好心！要不是格林你在，我刚刚就危险了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "还有一个。他是我的猎物，我来了结他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "（要杀了他......对，我该杀了他。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "（只要这样刺下去，放轻松，明椒，这很简单......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "......呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "你还在犹豫什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "我没有犹豫......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "（我没有犹豫......我是个雇佣兵，杀人而已......杀掉敌人而已！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "（这有什么好犹豫的？我、我......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "我现在就......现在就杀了他！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "到此为止。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "什么？但是格林，我还没有——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "你下不了手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "不！你相信我......我可以！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "你根本还什么都不明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "如果连这样的人你都没法下手，我可以断言，你没法继续做雇佣兵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "你很快就会死。死在某个战场上，这倒算是还不错的结局了，你甚至可能死在一个无关紧要的地方，还得我去给你收尸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "......但我就是雇佣兵啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "我们这样的雇佣兵总有一天都会死，这不是你说的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "我们这样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "哈，你我可不一样......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "......格林，有的时候我会觉得很害怕......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "怕什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "就像格林你说的那样，今天倒在这的可能是我，如果格林你不在，我就会这样被杀掉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "你们有可能会在很久之后才发现我，然后要等更长时间，在小镇上的姥姥才会收到这个消息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "之前弗雷德出事的时候，就是这样。我一直记得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "生离死别是常事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "嗯......我知道，你经常这么说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "我不怕死，真的不怕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "但我怕有一天我真的回不去了，姥姥却还一直等我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "这一次就这么算了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "格林......！不，等等，我真的可以——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "我看够闹剧了，所以到此为止。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "但是臭丫头，你记住了，要是继续跟着我们走下去，你总还会遇到必须要动手的时候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "嗯......我明白......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "你明白？我看不见得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "......这样或许会害了你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "明椒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "别去伦蒂尼姆了，你不合适。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "可是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "格林你不是说，只要这次能打赢，我们就能有好日子过了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "我能战斗，我一定可以帮上忙的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "这不光是战斗的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "我会把我的一切压在这次的任务上，那是因为我曾经见过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "见过什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "我见过我们萨卡兹有家的样子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "家......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "也许没那么好，但只要有一点可能，我就愿意拼一把。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "可你不同。你还能有选择。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "我......我的选择？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "我不知道......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "除了跟着大家一起，我还能去哪呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "我想回小镇，继续像之前一样过日子，可是......我们真的能吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "其实我有想过的，这次去伦蒂尼姆的任务，比之前的所有任务都要难，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "算是吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "未来有一天，可能格林你也会倒在什么地方，就这么丢了命......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "......那我就不给你准备明年的生日礼物了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "给你，今年的礼物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "......指套？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "不许说太鲜艳！不许说浪费时间！不许说不需要！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "你、你要是死掉，我是不会伤心的，我保证。对我们萨卡兹来说，生离死别不算什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "但如果可以不死......不管是被狠狠揍一顿也好，还是拿不到报酬也好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "怎么样都行。白跑一趟赚不到钱也没什么，我都不介意！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "至少......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "至少我希望在任务结束之后，大家还能一起回来......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "......天真的想法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "萨卡兹的年轻人难道都像你这么天真？我知道的萨卡兹不该这样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "怎么又骂我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "难道萨卡兹就不能希望身边的人都平安了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "可我就是这么想的......我就是萨卡兹啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "这样的萨卡兹总会死在战场上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "......我可不想看到你的死相，臭丫头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "text": "走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "text": "什么意思......哎，等等我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
